<title>AUSTRIA: Caradon Stelrad Austria acquires Czech.</title>
<headline>Caradon Stelrad Austria acquires Czech.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian radiator maker Caradon Stelrad Austria, a unit of Britain's Caradon Plc, said on Thursday it had taken a majority stake in leading Czech radiator maker Univa.</p>
<p>In a statement, Caradon said the acquisition of Brno-based Univa was a first step into the expanding markets of Central and Eastern Europe. Univa employs 300 staff.</p>
<p>Caradon gave no financial details of the deal.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +43-1 531 12 254</p>
